{"id":"47c9273664941e32","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-measure-representation.md","title":"测度下实数与二进制序列的部分表示","display":"df-measure-representation — 测度下实数与二进制序列的部分表示","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-measure-representation","aliases":["43-df-measure-representation"],"display":"df-measure-representation — 测度下实数与二进制序列的部分表示","depends_on":["[[43-df-measure-atoms]]","[[43-df-measure-interval]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.9.2 Lemma 9.9.4之后的表示约定，印刷199，PDF219","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false,"local_proof_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-measure-representation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-measure-representation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-measure-representation — 测度下实数与二进制序列的部分表示"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6b32588f9bb461b3\" href=\"?note=6b32588f9bb461b3\" title=\"43-df-measure-atoms\">43-df-measure-atoms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ebc4b4ba832fc281\" href=\"?note=ebc4b4ba832fc281\" title=\"43-df-measure-interval\">43-df-measure-interval</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.9.2 Lemma 9.9.4之后的表示约定，印刷199，PDF219"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 是Cantor空间Borel概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_\\nu\">\\(I_\\nu\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ebc4b4ba832fc281\" href=\"?note=ebc4b4ba832fc281\" title=\"43-df-measure-interval\">43-df-measure-interval</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\">\\(\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6b32588f9bb461b3\" href=\"?note=6b32588f9bb461b3\" title=\"43-df-measure-atoms\">43-df-measure-atoms</a>。以下以图定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{real}_\\nu\">\\(\\operatorname{real}_\\nu\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{seq}_\\nu\">\\(\\operatorname{seq}_\\nu\\)</span>，其定义域分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\nu\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(E_\\nu\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_\\nu\\subseteq[0,1]\">\\(D_\\nu\\subseteq[0,1]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists!\">\\(\\exists!\\)</span> 为唯一存在量词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_\\nu=2^\\omega\\setminus\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_\\nu=2^\\omega\\setminus\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_\\nu=\\left\\{t\\in[0,1]:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists!\\sigma\\in2^n\\;t\\in I_\\nu(\\sigma)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_\\nu=\\left\\{t\\in[0,1]:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists!\\sigma\\in2^n\\;t\\in I_\\nu(\\sigma)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{real}_\\nu=\\left\\{(X,t)\\in E_\\nu\\times[0,1]:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;t\\in I_\\nu(X\\upharpoonright n)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{real}_\\nu=\\left\\{(X,t)\\in E_\\nu\\times[0,1]:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;t\\in I_\\nu(X\\upharpoonright n)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{seq}_\\nu=\\left\\{(t,X)\\in D_\\nu\\times2^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;t\\in I_\\nu(X\\upharpoonright n)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{seq}_\\nu=\\left\\{(t,X)\\in D_\\nu\\times2^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;t\\in I_\\nu(X\\upharpoonright n)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>良定义性：沿X前缀的闭区间嵌套；由测度从上连续性，长度趋向ν({X})，故在Eν上交集为单点。对t∈Dν，每层唯一包含t的串彼此兼容，因而给出唯一无限序列。两域不能省略：原子可能对应正长度交区间，共享端点可能造成seqν多值。没有声称两个部分表示在全部[0,1]和全部2^ω之间互逆。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.9.2 Lemma 9.9.4之后的表示约定，印刷199，PDF219。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地推广或推论已单独注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-measure-atoms","status":"resolved","id":"6b32588f9bb461b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure-atoms]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure-interval","status":"resolved","id":"ebc4b4ba832fc281","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure-interval]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure-interval","status":"resolved","id":"ebc4b4ba832fc281","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是Cantor空间Borel概率测度，$I_\\nu$ 见 [[43-df-measure-interval]]，$\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)$ 见 [[43-df-measure-atoms]]。以下以图定义 $\\operatorname{real}_\\nu$ 与 $\\operatorname{seq}_\\nu$，其定义域分别为 $E_\\nu\\subseteq2^\\omega$ 与 $D_\\nu\\subseteq[0,1]$；$\\exists!$ 为唯一存在量词。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure-atoms","status":"resolved","id":"6b32588f9bb461b3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是Cantor空间Borel概率测度，$I_\\nu$ 见 [[43-df-measure-interval]]，$\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)$ 见 [[43-df-measure-atoms]]。以下以图定义 $\\operatorname{real}_\\nu$ 与 $\\operatorname{seq}_\\nu$，其定义域分别为 $E_\\nu\\subseteq2^\\omega$ 与 $D_\\nu\\subseteq[0,1]$；$\\exists!$ 为唯一存在量词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"I_\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{real}_\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{seq}_\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"E_\\nu\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\nu\\subseteq[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists!","display":false},{"tex":"E_\\nu=2^\\omega\\setminus\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu).","display":true},{"tex":"D_\\nu=\\left\\{t\\in[0,1]:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists!\\sigma\\in2^n\\;t\\in I_\\nu(\\sigma)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{real}_\\nu=\\left\\{(X,t)\\in E_\\nu\\times[0,1]:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;t\\in I_\\nu(X\\upharpoonright n)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{seq}_\\nu=\\left\\{(t,X)\\in D_\\nu\\times2^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;t\\in I_\\nu(X\\upharpoonright n)\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2009,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-248","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-measure-representation]] — 测度下实数与二进制序列的部分表示"}],"outgoing":["6b32588f9bb461b3","ebc4b4ba832fc281"]}